    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Don't worry, I'll go through it in a moment. So, based on your history, this looks most like insomnia, probably stress-related. The reason I say that is that the way you describe it fits together. We shouldn't forget a thyroid problem.",
