      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's insomnia, probably stress-related, and we'll know more once the a sleep study is back. Let me just check I've got this right. You've had trouble sleeping for two months, severe, and no snoring or low mood.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:40",
