      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Let's get a sleep study, for insomnia. Let's book a thyroid test to look into insomnia. Same wake-up time every day, no screens in the hour before bed, and no coffee after lunch. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose. I'd like you back in four weeks. Okay, we're done for today. Take care.",
